    "registration": "5677b1cb93ac8d2a943d4447b86ff108c811e287 gives only the MSVC Debug coupling test 90 seconds. Whole-suite measurements at the earlier 60-second cap were 54.44 s and 42.03 s. CTest JSON confirms Debug 90, Release 60; after the change the same Debug test finished in 51.16 s.",
    "catch": "A typed transient clock binds both flow fields to one exact stage; 1 case with 173 assertions in MSVC and GCC Release, seed 23.",
