    "negative": "Same binary64 time words but different actual schedules, a changed unselected interval, changed wake coefficients, wrong stamp or side, invalid addresses, interval/step limits, strict projection and retry. Match source stamp and schema revisions, exact interval content and both fields. Output SchemaIdentity belongs to the prepared side.",
    "mutation": "Byte-identical control at 8a69b27: 173 assertions pass. Omitting exact beginning and end comparisons lets the same-binary64 schedule through and fails one assertion (Catch2 exit 42).",
    "static": "clang-format 21.1.2 and clang-tidy 21.1.1 on the product and regression translation units in MSVC and GCC databases."
